        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Deltana SS35BU, 3-1/2\" x 3-1/2\" Heavy Duty Grade Stainless Steel Hinge 2 Ball Bearings</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe 3-1/2 x 3-1/2 x Square Corners Stainless Steel Hinge has 2 Ball Bearings, making it a good choice for heavier doors. A heavy duty hinge, its leaves are 0.119 inches thick. Heavy duty hinges are normally installed on commercial doors. This 3-1/2 Stainless Steel Hinge comes packaged as a set of 2 hinges; also included in the box are both machine and wood screws. The Deltana SS35BU Stainless Steel Hinge features a removable, stainless steel pin.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SS35U.gif?v=1704354591\" width=\"300\" height=\"335\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deltana SS35BUx Hinge Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the 3-1/2 Stainless Steel Hinge with Ball Bearings:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Hinge Material: 304 Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Height: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 3-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Corners: Square</li>\r\n<li>Thickness: 0.119\" (Heavy Duty)</li>\r\n<li>Ball Bearings: 2BB\r\n<li>Standard Template Hole Pattern</li>\r\n<li>Hinge Pin: Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Wood Screws: #10 x 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Machine Screws: #10-24 x 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DEL-SS35BUx.pdf?v=1704262170\" target=\"new\"><b>Deltana SS35BUx Hinge Specifications (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Sold in Pairs (2 Hinges)</b>\r\n</p>",
