                "title": "3-1/2 x 3-1/2 x Square Corners Stainless Steel Hinge 2 Ball Bearings",
                "description": "Deltana SS35BUx - 3-1/2 x 3-1/2 Stainless Steel Door Hinges. 2 Ball Bearings, Square Corners a Heavy duty 0.119 thick (gauge). Package includes a pair of hinges with Stainless Steel screws. Available in Satin or Polished Stainless finish.",
